      <h1 class="Title">CODE COMPARATIVE TABLE—ORDINANCES</h1>
            <p class="P1">The following table reflects the disposition in this Code of Ordinances enacted subsequent to the Revised Ordinances, 1962. Ordinances not listed herein have been omitted as repealed, superseded, or not of a general or permanent nature.</p>

