<p id="current">The Burlington Code of Ordinances is current through Ord. 8-3-26, passed August 3, 2026.</p>
<p id="disclaimer">Disclaimer: The city clerk’s office has the official version of the Burlington Code of Ordinances. Users should contact the city clerk’s office for ordinances passed subsequent to the ordinance cited above.</p>

